# 🚀 Installation & Deployment

## 1. Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/mothishwariv/Student-Enrollment-course-Management-System-SECMS-.git
```

## 2. Navigate to the Project

```bash
cd Student-Enrollment-course-Management-System-SECMS-
```

## 3. Authenticate with Salesforce Org

```bash
sf org login web -a SECMS-Org
```

## 4. Deploy the Project

```bash
sf project deploy start --source-dir force-app
```

## 5. Assign Permission Set

```bash
sf org assign permset -n SECMS_Admin
```

